  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Satin Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A hydrating, comfort-wear liquid lipstick in buildable satin shades with an innovative applicator that hugs the lip to define and fill in one step.<br><b><br>Formulation Type: </b>Liquid Lipstick<br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Hydrating and Long-wearing<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Macadamia Oil: Calms and visibly brightens lips.<br>- Licorice Root Extract: An antioxidant that nourishes and protects.<br>- Vitamin E: A rich, nourishing oil that softens and smooths lips.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Upon first use, twist the bottom five to seven full turns to activate the pack and release fresh formula<br>-For ongoing use, use two to four individual clicks to dispense the perfect amount<br>-Apply evenly across upper and lower lips<br>-Use the tip of the doe foot to clean up and outline edges</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Macadamia Oil: Calms and visibly brightens lips.<br>-Licorice Root Extract: An antioxidant that nourishes and protects.<br>-Vitamin E: A rich, nourishing oil that softens and smooths lips.<br><br>Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate/Dimer Dilinoleate Copolymer, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-<br>2, Triheptanoin, Kaolin, Silica, C9-12 Alkane, Dilinoleic Acid/Butanediol Copolymer, Lauroyl Lysine, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, C18-36 Acid Triglyceride, Tribehenin, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Seed Extract, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Trihydroxystearin, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Castor Oil/IPDI Copolymer, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Leaf Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Polyglyceryl-2 Tetraisostearate, Phospholipids, Aluminum Hydroxide [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Red 7 (CI 15850), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Iron Oxides (CI 77492,CI 77491,CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)].</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Satin Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A hydrating, comfort-wear liquid lipstick in buildable satin shades with an innovative applicator that hugs the lip to define and fill in one step.<br><b><br>Formulation Type: </b>Liquid Lipstick<br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Hydrating and Long-wearing<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Macadamia Oil: Calms and visibly brightens lips.<br>- Licorice Root Extract: An antioxidant that nourishes and protects.<br>- Vitamin E: A rich, nourishing oil that softens and smooths lips.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Upon first use, twist the bottom five to seven full turns to activate the pack and release fresh formula<br>-For ongoing use, use two to four individual clicks to dispense the perfect amount<br>-Apply evenly across upper and lower lips<br>-Use the tip of the doe foot to clean up and outline edges</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Macadamia Oil: Calms and visibly brightens lips.<br>-Licorice Root Extract: An antioxidant that nourishes and protects.<br>-Vitamin E: A rich, nourishing oil that softens and smooths lips.<br><br>Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate/Dimer Dilinoleate Copolymer, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-<br>2, Triheptanoin, Kaolin, Silica, C9-12 Alkane, Dilinoleic Acid/Butanediol Copolymer, Lauroyl Lysine, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, C18-36 Acid Triglyceride, Tribehenin, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Seed Extract, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Trihydroxystearin, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Castor Oil/IPDI Copolymer, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Leaf Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Polyglyceryl-2 Tetraisostearate, Phospholipids, Aluminum Hydroxide [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Red 7 (CI 15850), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Iron Oxides (CI 77492,CI 77491,CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)].</div></details>",
